</h2><div class="bde-shortcode-390-189 bde-shortcode"><div class="nst nst-component-faq" style="--nst-accent:#00538C"><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>Who Is the Highest-Paid Player on the Dallas Mavericks?</summary><p>Kyrie Irving has the largest current cap hit at $39,491,282. His listed cash salary is $39,491,282.</p></details><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>What Is the Dallas Mavericks Payroll?</summary><p>The active roster cap payroll is $177,194,562 for 2026–27 in the 2026-10-21 snapshot. Dead cap and cap holds are separate.</p></details><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>How Much of the Salary Cap Does the Roster Use?</summary><p>Standard-roster cap charges equal 107.42% of the NBA’s $164,961,000 salary cap. This can exceed 100% because NBA rules allow certain exceptions.</p></details><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>Are Future Contract Totals Fully Guaranteed?</summary><p>No. Scheduled years can include player options, team options and conditional protection. The contract table identifies options where confirmed.</p></details><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>Why Are Salary and Cap Hit Different?</summary><p>Incentives, contract rules and minimum-salary adjustments can make a player’s cash pay differ from the amount charged to the team’s salary cap.</p></details><p class="nst-note"><a href="/methodology/">Research methodology</a> · <a href="/contact/">Report a correction</a></p><details class="nst-accordion"><summary>Data References</summary><ul><li><a href="https://www.spotrac.com/nba/dallas-mavericks/yearly">www.spotrac.com</a></li><li><a href="https://www.nba.com/news/nba-salary-cap-2026-27-season">www.nba.com</a></li><li><a href="https://www.nba.com/mavs/news/mavs-honor-co-founder-norm-sonju-the-visionary-who-brought-the-mavs-to-dallas">www.nba.com</a></li><li><a href="https://www.nba.com/news/dallas-mavericks-nba-championship">www.nba.com</a></li><li><a href="https://jjnba.com/repeater/">Taxpayer history: JJNBA / Jeremia